  "content": {
    "id": "p29-q11-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "The distance between two towns $A$ and $B$ is 450 km. Find $x$ if:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p29-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the trip takes $x$ hours at an average speed of 90 km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=5\\text{ hours}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{450}{90}\\\\x&=5\\end{align*}$$\nThe trip takes 5 hours.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p29-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "the trip takes $5\\frac14$ hours at an average speed of $x$ km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=85\\frac57\\text{ km/h}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x&=450\\div\\frac{21}{4}\\\\x&=450\\times\\frac4{21}\\\\x&=\\frac{600}{7}\\\\x&=85\\frac57\\end{align*}$$\nThe average speed is $85\\frac57$ km/h.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p29-q11-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "the trip takes 5 hours, travelling $x$ hours at 110 km/h and the remaining time at 60 km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3\\text{ hours}$\n\nUse $5-x$ hours for the time at 60 km/h and add the two distances.",
          "worked": "The time at 60 km/h is $(5-x)$ hours. Using distance = speed × time,\n$$\\begin{align*}110x+60(5-x)&=450\\\\110x+300-60x&=450\\\\50x+300&=450\\\\50x&=150\\\\x&=3\\end{align*}$$\nThe time at 110 km/h is 3 hours.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      }
    ]
  },
